OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry and bright start,
OL,6,Fwith local frost and fog patches,
OL,7,Fcloud will thicken. Outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fwill then spread north and east in the
OL,9,Fafternoon, perhaps heavy in places.
OL,10,FMilder in the south, chilly further
OL,11,Fnorth. Breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with rain then showers
OL,14,Fovernight. Becoming cold, with a local
OL,15,Fgrass frost. Winds strengthening from
OL,16,Fthe west in the early hours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
