OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy with a few isolated
OL,6,Fshowers at first. Dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells from late morning. Increasingly
OL,8,Fwindy and cloudy overnight as rain
OL,9,Fspreads north. Chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fand unsettled, with spells of rain and
OL,13,Fstrong winds at times Tuesday to
OL,14,FThursday. Generally mild, especially
OL,15,Fby night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
